{#
After "Move to" — from the list toolbar for a selection, or from the reading
pane for the one conversation open in it.

Not thread/status/_move.stream.html.twig, which answers a drop on a folder, and
the two differ in the one thing that file hard-codes: whether the rows leave. A
drop always takes the conversation out of the list it was dragged from. This
does only when the list was the label that came off — moved from the Inbox, the
row goes; filed from a search result, it is still a search result and is redrawn
with its new chip instead. Which is which is decided per conversation by
MoveToService::staysInView(), after the move, from what the thread now carries.

Variables:
  count      how many conversations were moved
  threads    all of them
  staying    the ones still in the list they were moved from
  label      the target, for the toast
  undoToken  from StatusUndoService::remember()
  message    optional, already translated: what the toast says instead of
             "Moved to …" — the spam button's, which may also have made a filter
#}
<!-- plmail-bulk: {{ count }} -->

{% for thread in threads %}
    {% if thread in staying %}
        <turbo-stream action="replace" target="thread_{{ thread.id }}">
            <template>
                {% include '_partials/_thread_row.html.twig' with { thread: thread } only %}
            </template>
        </turbo-stream>
    {% else %}
        <turbo-stream action="remove" target="thread_{{ thread.id }}">
        </turbo-stream>
    {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% include 'thread/status/_undo_toast.stream.html.twig' with {
    message:   message|default('toast.moved'|trans({ '%folder%': label|label_name })),
    undoToken: undoToken,
} only %}
